Frequently asked questions
Good to know
Is DEUTSCHE FINANCE a real bank?
No. This is an independent, fictional prototype built for demonstration and learning purposes. It is not affiliated with Deutsche Bank AG or any real financial institution.
Can I use real account or card information?
No. This site never asks for real banking passwords, PINs, CVVs, or card numbers. Please only ever enter fictional, made-up test data.
Where is my data stored?
Test data you enter is stored locally in your own browser for demonstration purposes only. It is not sent to a real bank and is not a secure authentication system.
Can I reset my test account?
Yes — clearing your browser's local storage for this site will reset all test accounts and data.
